This project is a Swift / SwiftUI port of Ehviewer_CN_SXJ
(https://github.com/xiaojieonly/Ehviewer_CN_SXJ, Copyright (C) xiaojieonly and
contributors), which is based on EhViewer by Hippo Seven
(https://github.com/seven332/EhViewer). The business logic (HTML parsers, URL
builders, the reader loader, download management, the .ehviewer file format,
the database schema and the Wi-Fi transfer protocol) was translated from the
Android source code into Swift; the user interface was rewritten for iOS.

