The app icon comes from EhViewer. The HTML test fixtures in
EhKit/Tests/EhCoreTests/Fixtures are copied from the Ehviewer_CN_SXJ test
resources.

Chinese tag translations come from the EhTagTranslation project
(https://github.com/EhTagTranslation/Database). The app downloads them at
runtime from the tag-translations branch of https://github.com/Mapaler/EhViewer
(the same source as the Android app); they are not part of this repository.

